{"id":"ac5c4072279f0088","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-assignment.md","title":"赋值","display":"df-assignment — 赋值","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-assignment","aliases":["29-df-assignment"],"display":"df-assignment — 赋值","depends_on":["[[29-df-structure]]","[[29-df-variable]]"],"source_locator":"§1.1; Definition 1.3, pp.6–7, scans 21–22; pp.21–22, scans 36–37","source_basis":"原书陈述核对及本地语义修订；证明范围见 Remark","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29(2).zip修订；既有原书定位、日期和过往核对叙述作为继承记录，未重新取得或查看原书原件","revision_verification":"声明、类型、绑定、递归及书内链接审查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-assignment"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-assignment</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-assignment — 赋值"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0ac4b9a122d458e2\" href=\"?note=0ac4b9a122d458e2\" title=\"29-df-structure\">29-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ad08b66c5e54a436\" href=\"?note=ad08b66c5e54a436\" title=\"29-df-variable\">29-df-variable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"§1.1; Definition 1.3, pp.6–7, scans 21–22; pp.21–22, scans 36–37"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"原书陈述核对及本地语义修订；证明范围见 Remark"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(2).zip修订；既有原书定位、日期和过往核对叙述作为继承记录，未重新取得或查看原书原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"声明、类型、绑定、递归及书内链接审查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-assignment-—-赋值-$\\beta$\">df-assignment — 赋值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}[\\tau]\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}[\\tau]\\)</span> 为任意非空结构，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0ac4b9a122d458e2\" href=\"?note=0ac4b9a122d458e2\" title=\"29-df-structure\">29-df-structure</a>；不要求有限。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span> 为可数个体变量集，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ad08b66c5e54a436\" href=\"?note=ad08b66c5e54a436\" title=\"29-df-variable\">29-df-variable</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in|A|\">\\(a\\in|A|\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>更新式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 遍历下式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\">\\(\\bar x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\)</span> 分量互异，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar a=(a_1,\\ldots,a_k)\\in|A|^k\">\\(\\bar a=(a_1,\\ldots,a_k)\\in|A|^k\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha:D\\to|A|\">\\(\\alpha:D\\to|A|\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对多个变量块，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，各块内部及块间变量均互异；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vert\">\\(\\Vert\\)</span> 为元组串接，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar a_i\">\\(\\bar a_i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x_i\">\\(\\bar x_i\\)</span> 等长。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>多块局部赋值的每个块 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x_i\">\\(\\bar x_i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar a_i\">\\(\\bar a_i\\)</span> 等长，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar a_i\\in|A|^{|\\bar x_i|}\">\\(\\bar a_i\\in|A|^{|\\bar x_i|}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\left|\\bigcup_{i=1}^m\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x_i)\\right|=\\sum_{i=1}^m|\\bar x_i|\">\\(\\left|\\bigcup_{i=1}^m\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x_i)\\right|=\\sum_{i=1}^m|\\bar x_i|\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=0\">\\(m=0\\)</span> 时串接、并集和局部赋值均为空。以下不带初始 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 的方括号表示局部函数，而不是语法替换。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\coloneqq\\{\\beta\\mid\\beta:\\mathrm{Var}\\to|A|\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\coloneqq\\{\\beta\\mid\\beta:\\mathrm{Var}\\to|A|\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\beta[a/x](y)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a,&amp;y=x,\\\\\\beta(y),&amp;y\\ne x.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\beta[a/x](y)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a,&amp;y=x,\\\\\\beta(y),&amp;y\\ne x.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\beta(\\bar x)\\coloneqq(\\beta(x_1),\\ldots,\\beta(x_k)),\\qquad\\beta[\\bar a/\\bar x](y)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a_i,&amp;y=x_i\\ (1\\leq i\\leq k),\\\\\\beta(y),&amp;y\\notin\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x).\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\beta(\\bar x)\\coloneqq(\\beta(x_1),\\ldots,\\beta(x_k)),\\qquad\\beta[\\bar a/\\bar x](y)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a_i,&amp;y=x_i\\ (1\\leq i\\leq k),\\\\\\beta(y),&amp;y\\notin\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x).\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"[\\bar a/\\bar x]\\coloneqq\\{(x_i,a_i)\\mid1\\leq i\\leq k\\},\\quad\\operatorname{Ext}_A(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\{\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\mid\\beta\\upharpoonright D=\\alpha\\},\\quad\\beta\\sqcup\\alpha\\coloneqq\\alpha\\cup(\\beta\\upharpoonright(\\mathrm{Var}\\setminus D)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[[\\bar a/\\bar x]\\coloneqq\\{(x_i,a_i)\\mid1\\leq i\\leq k\\},\\quad\\operatorname{Ext}_A(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\{\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\mid\\beta\\upharpoonright D=\\alpha\\},\\quad\\beta\\sqcup\\alpha\\coloneqq\\alpha\\cup(\\beta\\upharpoonright(\\mathrm{Var}\\setminus D)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\beta[\\bar a_1,\\ldots,\\bar a_m/\\bar x_1,\\ldots,\\bar x_m]\\coloneqq\\beta[(\\bar a_1\\Vert\\cdots\\Vert\\bar a_m)/(\\bar x_1\\Vert\\cdots\\Vert\\bar x_m)],\\qquad\\beta[\\bar a/\\bar x,\\bar b/\\bar y]\\coloneqq\\beta[\\bar a,\\bar b/\\bar x,\\bar y].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\beta[\\bar a_1,\\ldots,\\bar a_m/\\bar x_1,\\ldots,\\bar x_m]\\coloneqq\\beta[(\\bar a_1\\Vert\\cdots\\Vert\\bar a_m)/(\\bar x_1\\Vert\\cdots\\Vert\\bar x_m)],\\qquad\\beta[\\bar a/\\bar x,\\bar b/\\bar y]\\coloneqq\\beta[\\bar a,\\bar b/\\bar x,\\bar y].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"[\\bar a_1,\\ldots,\\bar a_m/\\bar x_1,\\ldots,\\bar x_m]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i=1}^m[\\bar a_i/\\bar x_i],\\qquad[\\bar a/\\bar x,\\bar b/\\bar y]\\coloneqq[\\bar a,\\bar b/\\bar x,\\bar y].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[[\\bar a_1,\\ldots,\\bar a_m/\\bar x_1,\\ldots,\\bar x_m]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i=1}^m[\\bar a_i/\\bar x_i],\\qquad[\\bar a/\\bar x,\\bar b/\\bar y]\\coloneqq[\\bar a,\\bar b/\\bar x,\\bar y].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}([\\bar a_1,\\ldots,\\bar a_m/\\bar x_1,\\ldots,\\bar x_m])=\\bigcup_{i=1}^m\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x_i),\\qquad[\\bar a_1,\\ldots,\\bar a_m/\\bar x_1,\\ldots,\\bar x_m]=[(\\bar a_1\\Vert\\cdots\\Vert\\bar a_m)/(\\bar x_1\\Vert\\cdots\\Vert\\bar x_m)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{dom}([\\bar a_1,\\ldots,\\bar a_m/\\bar x_1,\\ldots,\\bar x_m])=\\bigcup_{i=1}^m\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x_i),\\qquad[\\bar a_1,\\ldots,\\bar a_m/\\bar x_1,\\ldots,\\bar x_m]=[(\\bar a_1\\Vert\\cdots\\Vert\\bar a_m)/(\\bar x_1\\Vert\\cdots\\Vert\\bar x_m)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §1.1、Definition 1.3，印刷页 6–7，扫描页 21–22。将赋值接口从有限结构推广到任意非空结构；相同函数构造无需有限性。有限结构上的原有含义保持一致。此推广为 p.21–22 明确提到的任意模型紧致性、完备性提供语义接口。</p>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本的类型、条件和依赖闭合为依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-assignment-—-赋值-$\\beta$","text":"df-assignment — 赋值 $\\beta$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"0ac4b9a122d458e2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"ad08b66c5e54a436","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"0ac4b9a122d458e2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}[\\tau]$ 为任意非空结构，见 [[29-df-structure]]；不要求有限。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-variable","status":"resolve