\\ldots,\\bar a_m/\\bar x_1,\\ldots,\\bar x_m]\\coloneqq\\beta[(\\bar a_1\\Vert\\cdots\\Vert\\bar a_m)/(\\bar x_1\\Vert\\cdots\\Vert\\bar x_m)],\\qquad\\beta[\\bar a/\\bar x,\\bar b/\\bar y]\\coloneqq\\beta[\\bar a,\\bar b/\\bar x,\\bar y].","display":true},{"tex":"[\\bar a_1,\\ldots,\\bar a_m/\\bar x_1,\\ldots,\\bar x_m]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i=1}^m[\\bar a_i/\\bar x_i],\\qquad[\\bar a/\\bar x,\\bar b/\\bar y]\\coloneqq[\\bar a,\\bar b/\\bar x,\\bar y].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}([\\bar a_1,\\ldots,\\bar a_m/\\bar x_1,\\ldots,\\bar x_m])=\\bigcup_{i=1}^m\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x_i),\\qquad[\\bar a_1,\\ldots,\\bar a_m/\\bar x_1,\\ldots,\\bar x_m]=[(\\bar a_1\\Vert\\cdots\\Vert\\bar a_m)/(\\bar x_1\\Vert\\cdots\\Vert\\bar x_m)].","display":true}],"bytes":3440,"backlinks":[{"id":"8aaa1b11a3581173","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"587fa3c5f12ce89b","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]$，$\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)$；$\\beta[a/x]$ 取 [[29-df-assignment]] 的赋值更新。原子满足关系取 [[29-df-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"533aac05e72771cc","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f49962f64360a930","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A[\\rho:=\\mathbf X]$ 保留输入结构全部解释并增加辅助关系；$h=(r_1,\\ldots,r_l)\\in H_n$。$B_t^{\\Pi,n,h}$ 是完整输入及辅助状态。更新公式均在旧 $B_t$ 上求值。单块与多块局部赋值取 [[29-df-assignment]]，其满足关系取 [[29-df-satisfaction]]；每次调用都满足 $\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\alpha)$，其中 $\\alpha$ 是所显示的局部赋值。"},{"id":"103ef7b4129ffc8e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9e37f96b88bff2af","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"37df1473b45d1ebc","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ad67d470dcdc91b8","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d8799e17a4ba0440","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"edcb3c1ba71c78c8","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9f21a81def92d642","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"98a7b2fe455fde6b","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1f29a86741dce65f","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"10608c2a55a773a6","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b961a724325c53e7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3f8441c5cf2fdcc5","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)$；赋值和 FO 满足关系见 [[29-df-assignment]]、[[29-df-satisfaction]]。$Z_i^{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}$ 在下面构造为给定绑定关系及变量组的空初态迭代。"},{"id":"202a9b00a002bd02","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak{A})$ (see [[29-df-assignment]])"},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[29-df-assignment]]、[[29-df-satisfaction]] — 赋值与满足"},{"id":"da1408963eb3a178","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$I\\subseteq\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}$；位置 $p:I\\to|A|\\times|B|$，写 $p(i)=(a_i,b_i)$。$\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)$、$\\mathrm{Assgn}(B)$ 取 [[29-df-assignment]] 的全赋值类；下式以全赋值延拓评价自由变量全在已放卵石域内的原子。"},{"id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak{A})$ (see [[29-df-assignment]])"},{"id":"165874db46d8b664","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8372f1f6b9135d87","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\eta[R\\mapsto S]$ 仅更新 $R$ 的值为 $S\\subseteq|A|^k$；个体赋值更新见 [[29-df-assignment]]。"},{"id":"e0bc79e